.DS_Store
*.zip

# No audio lives in git.
#
# WAV masters are kept on Carl's machine at ~/Music/Masters/<Album>/ and are the
# source of truth. scripts/sync-album.sh encodes them to MP3/M4A and uploads
# those to the "latest" GitHub Release, which is what catalog.json points at.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a

# ...except the streaming copies. iOS refuses release assets outright: they are
# served as application/octet-stream through a signed cross-host redirect and
# fail with SRC_NOT_SUPPORTED. raw.githubusercontent serves a clean path as
# audio/mpeg, which iOS accepts, so the site streams from here instead. These are
# 128k copies for playback only -- the full-quality MP3/M4A stay in the release
# for downloads.
!stream/*.mp3

# Encode-cache sidecars (live under ~/Music/Masters/.encoded, never in git)
*.src-sha256
